Package: com.heavenzy.tweak
Name: Heavenzy
Version: 1.3.4
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Per-app device identity reset (Blaze-style): keeps your real iPhone model but resets serial, UDID, IDFV, IDFA, Wi-Fi/Bluetooth MAC and IMEI, plus a wipe + re-spoof that clears saved accounts and blocks iCloud restore, so an app sees a brand-new phone with a first-time install. Hold two fingers on any app to open the draggable Heavenzy SMS panel (touches pass through around it) to order a USA number via DiddySMS or GrizzlySMS and show the verification code; the service is detected from the app name. Configure apps and SMS API keys in the Heavenzy app. Close the panel with its X.
Maintainer: Heavenzy
Author: Heavenzy
Section: Tweaks
Depends: ellekit
